---
import SiteLayout from "../../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
import pages from "../../../data/pages.json";
---

<SiteLayout metadata={pages["/compare/otto-vs-simplepractice/"]}>
  <main id="main" class="ed-page">
    <div class="wrap">
      <nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a> <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>{" "}
        <a href="/compare/">Compare EHRs</a> <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>{" "}
        <span aria-current="page">Otto vs. SimplePractice</span>
      </nav>
      <header class="ed-compact">
        <div class="eyebrow">Otto vs. SimplePractice</div>
        <h1>
          Choose an EHR that
          <br />
          carries the visit forward.
        </h1>
        <p>
          Looking for a SimplePractice alternative? Otto brings session prep,
          clinical documentation, approved chart updates, and cash-pay
          collection into a connected workflow for independent mental health
          practices.
        </p>
        <div class="ed-actions">
          <a class="button" href="/demo/#watch">
            Watch Otto in action ↗
          </a>
          <a class="text-link" href="#comparison">
            Compare the details ↓
          </a>
        </div>
      </header>
      <section class="ed-section">
        <div class="ed-section-head">
          <div>
            <span class="eyebrow">Why consider Otto</span>
            <h2>Follow the work through to the next step.</h2>
          </div>
          <p>
            Otto’s central idea is a connected practice day: useful context
            before the visit, documentation you review, and a clear path into
            the chart and payment.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="ed-facts">
          <section>
            <span class="tag">01</span>
            <h3>The context comes with you</h3>
            <p>
              Patient summaries and last-session highlights connect preparation
              to the documented history.
            </p>
          </section>
          <section>
            <span class="tag">02</span>
            <h3>The note moves the work forward</h3>
            <p>
              After signature, Otto proposes structured chart updates and
              carries the visit into charge review.
            </p>
          </section>
          <section>
            <span class="tag">03</span>
            <h3>Clinical changes need your approval</h3>
            <p>
              Review the note, then confirm or dismiss the proposed diagnoses,
              plan items, and medication changes.
            </p>
          </section>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="ed-section" id="comparison">
        <div class="ed-section-head">
          <div>
            <span class="eyebrow">A practical side-by-side</span>
            <h2>Compare what your day needs.</h2>
          </div>
          <p>
            Both products offer AI documentation. Look at how the surrounding
            work fits together, then check the requirements specific to your
            practice.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="table-scroll">
          <table
            class="ed-table"
            aria-label="Otto and SimplePractice workflow comparison"
          >
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th scope="col">What to compare</th>
                <th scope="col">Otto</th>
                <th scope="col">SimplePractice</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr>
                <th scope="row">The visit workflow</th>
                <td>
                  Connects preparation, session capture, SOAP or DAP draft,
                  signature, approved chart updates, and cash-pay collection.
                </td>
                <td>
                  Offers practice management plus Care Aide tools for
                  documentation, telehealth support, and client recaps.
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <th scope="row">AI documentation</th>
                <td>
                  SOAP and DAP drafts from session audio, followed by clinician
                  review and signature.
                </td>
                <td>
                  Note Taker drafts notes; Care Aide also includes Session
                  Sidekick, Client Summaries, and a Treatment Planner labeled
                  beta.
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <th scope="row">After the note</th>
                <td>
                  Proposes structured diagnoses, treatment-plan items, and
                  medication updates for individual confirmation.
                </td>
                <td>
                  Evaluate how the Care Aide tools fit your documentation and
                  follow-up process in a demo.
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <th scope="row">Scheduling and telehealth</th>
                <td>
                  Recurring appointments, week and agenda views, integrated
                  telehealth, and patient context.
                </td>
                <td>
                  Scheduling and telehealth are available, with feature and plan
                  differences to evaluate.
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <th scope="row">Insurance and practice needs</th>
                <td>
                  The experience described here centers on solo, self-pay
                  practices. Confirm claims, group-practice, and prescribing
                  requirements with Otto.
                </td>
                <td>
                  Offers insurance workflows and group-practice options. Confirm
                  plan eligibility, payer support, and additional fees.
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <th scope="row">Cost and inclusions</th>
                <td>
                  Publicly advertises $99/month after trial. Confirm billing
                  unit, included usage, processing fees, and the offer for your
                  account.
                </td>
                <td>
                  Published standard base plans are $49, $79, and $99/month.
                  Note Taker and Care Aide are optional paid additions;
                  promotions and eligibility vary.
                </td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
        <div class="ed-source-list">
          <p>
            Sources checked October 16, 2026. Features, plan eligibility, and
            terms can change. Confirm requirements directly with each vendor.
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li>
              <a href="https://otto.tebra.com/">Otto product overview</a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="https://www.simplepractice.com/pricing/">
                SimplePractice plans and add-ons
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="https://www.simplepractice.com/features/ai-therapy-notes-taker/">
                SimplePractice Care Aide and Note Taker
              </a>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="ed-section">
        <div class="ed-choice">
          <div>
            <span class="eyebrow">Make the comparison tangible</span>
            <h2>Try one complete visit.</h2>
            <p>
              Use a fictional recurring client. Prepare from the previous note,
              complete a visit, correct the draft, confirm the record, and
              review the charge. Notice what you have to re-enter and where the
              next step is clear.
            </p>
            <a class="text-link" href="/demo/#watch">
              Follow that visit in Otto ↗
            </a>
          </div>
          <div class="ed-choice-links">
            <a href="/switch/from-simplepractice/">
              <strong>Prepare for a move ↗</strong>
              <span>
                Review records, export requirements, and the questions to ask
                before cutover.
              </span>
            </a>
            <a href="/tools/ehr-cost-calculator/">
              <strong>Compare the full cost ↗</strong>
              <span>
                Include software, AI, payments, claims, and setup in your own
                calculation.
              </span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="ed-section ed-faq">
        <div>
          <span class="eyebrow">A few useful answers</span>
          <h2>Get to know the details.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-list">
          <details>
            <summary>
              Why would I consider Otto if I already use SimplePractice?
            </summary>
            <p>
              Consider Otto if you want to evaluate a connected path from visit
              preparation through the signed note, approved chart changes, and
              cash-pay collection. Try the complete workflow and decide whether
              it addresses the repeated work in your day.
            </p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>Does SimplePractice also have AI features?</summary>
            <p>
              Yes. Its Care Aide suite includes Note Taker, Session Sidekick,
              Client Summaries, and a Treatment Planner labeled beta. Compare
              the full workflow and the features available on your plan.
            </p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>Can Otto replace every feature I use today?</summary>
            <p>
              Confirm your required capabilities before switching, especially
              insurance, custom paperwork, group care, prescribing, and team
              access. The{" "}
              <a href="/switch/from-simplepractice/">moving checklist</a> helps
              organize that evaluation.
            </p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>Will Otto import my SimplePractice records?</summary>
            <p>
              Ask Otto to confirm supported file formats, record categories,
              migration support, timing, and fees. Test a representative sample
              before planning a full move.
            </p>
          </details>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="ed-close">
        <div>
          <h2>See what a connected practice day can feel like.</h2>
          <p>
            Watch Otto carry a visit from preparation through documentation and
            payment. Then tell us about the way you practice.
          </p>
        </div>
        <a class="button light" href="/waitlist/">
          Join the waitlist ↗
        </a>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</SiteLayout>
